Files taken from the Cygnus 2.9-ee-991111 GCC tree (unmodified)
---------------------------------------------------------------
The game SDK's libgcc.a fp-bit.o and dp-bit.o were not built from FSF 2.95.3.
They come from the 2.9-ee-991111 tree's own config/fp-bit.c, which is 2.95.3
plus one CYGNUS LOCAL hunk in unpack_d (NO_DENORMALS: zero-exponent values
flush to zero), and from that tree's config/mips/t-r5900, whose dp-bit.c rule
defines NO_DENORMALS (FACT #9752, validated by FACT #9756). Vendored under
RULING #9753: the file's own licence header is the same GPL + link permission
+ libgcc special exception as the 2.95.3 file, and it reproduces the SDK
member byte-exact. That reproduction is the provenance evidence. No licensed
upstream copy of this tree is known. The fetch source is a third-party upload
that carries no licence of its own:
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SSXModding/ps2-ee-toolchain/b595ded606227e93b8c4a447446c1d2ac093827d/ee/gcc/<path>

  file                           upstream path             sha1
